cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NA Bar Finder Venue Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link to nabarfinder.com."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "NA Bar Finder"
    website: "https://nabarfinder.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22133238
url: "https://nabarfinder.com/developers/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nabarfinderops/data"
abstract: >-
  Bars, restaurants, cafes, kava bars and bottle shops with verified
  non-alcoholic drink programs across 70 cities in the US, UK, Canada,
  Australia and Singapore. Every record is human-verified and carries the date
  it was last checked; venues with a verified NA menu carry the menu items and
  the date the menu was last confirmed. Absent fields mean the detail is not
  known or not published, never zero. Monthly snapshots of the live feed at
  https://nabarfinder.com/api/v1/venues.json.
